      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Evidence, not authority\\nThis dashboard combines **Resolution Memory** and **security playbook** telemetry. Historical resolutions and Grafana state never grant execution authority. Client isolation, Central Orchestrator authorization, exact approvals, disruption controls, and provider readback remain authoritative.\\n\\n**Current milestone:** Resolution Memory has its first verified production case; Datto EDR/AV playbook v1.3 is production-enabled with terminal/sticky security escalation."
      }
